    '致謝': 'Credits',
    '要花多少資源讓環境光的影格與影片的影格同步。\n\n解碼影格率：CPU 與 GPU 使用量最低。\n可能會掉幀或延遲。\n\n顯示器影格率：CPU 與 GPU 使用量最高。\n在高更新率螢幕（120Hz 以上）或高於 1080p 的影片上仍可能延遲。\n\n影片影格率：CPU 與 GPU 使用量最低。\n使用最新的瀏覽器技術讓影格隨時保持同步。': 'How many resources are spent keeping the ambient light frames in sync with the video frames.\n\nDecoded frame rate: lowest CPU and GPU usage.\nFrames may drop or lag.\n\nDisplay frame rate: highest CPU and GPU usage.\nMay still lag on high refresh rate screens (120Hz and above) or videos above 1080p.\n\nVideo frame rate: lowest CPU and GPU usage.\nUses the latest browser technology to keep frames in sync at all times.',
    '重設所有設定': 'Reset all settings',
